{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is the Last Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short narrative game with a dark and heavy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience Jon\u2019s final day at work\u2014just before heading home\u2026 or so he thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/Frame_95.png?t=1744196473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Music and Sound design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With carefully selected and arranged audio, every detail serves a purpose. Listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0 Music by NicoTeenLow\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A brief story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple yet immersive experience, lasting no more than 5\u201310 minutes. The gameplay is minimal, but the atmosphere lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/Frame_98.png?t=1744196473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short and simple narrative exerience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark and heavy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist graphics with hand crafted 3D assets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554430?t=1744196473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/9d9473a56aacabbca14820f8e3b0df8ab87a47c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744196473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/cff31e23a5d4fcf4728b994bea147bc84125f2e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744196473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea